 Ōshima.","extract_html":"<p>The <b>Amami language</b> or languages, also known as <b>Amami Ōshima</b> or simply <b>Ōshima</b>, is a Ryukyuan language spoken in the Amami Islands south of Kyūshū. The southern variety of the Setouchi township may be a distinct language more closely related to Okinawan than it is to northern Ōshima.</p>"}